ENTRY            D4440   20260518   20261124   20261124       D153
SUBENT        D4440001   20260518   20261124   20261124       D153
BIB                 11         26
TITLE      Activation cross-sections of 3He-particle induced
           nuclear reactions on natural silver up to 27 MeV
AUTHOR     (B.M.Ali,A.Elbinawi,F.Ditroi,M.Al-Abyad)
INSTITUTE  (3EGYCAI,3HUNDEB)
REFERENCE  (J,ARI,225,112011,2025)
           #doi:10.1016/j.apradiso.2025.112011
FACILITY   (CYCLO,3HUNDEB)
SAMPLE     High chemical purity (99.99%), 8.1 um thick, natural
           isotopic composition Ag
DETECTOR   (HPGE)
METHOD     (ACTIV)
ERR-ANALYS (EN-ERR)
           Including the primary beam energy uncertainty and the
           uncertainty of target thickness (0.3-1.0 MeV)
           (ERR-T)
           The total uncertainty of the cross-section values
            (11-14%) is estimated using the standard method, which
           involves taking the quadratic sum of the independently
           contributing parameters.
           (ERR-S,1.0,8.0) statistical uncertainty (1-8%)
           (ERR-1) beam intensity (8%)
           (ERR-2) target thickness (5%)
           (ERR-3) detection efficiency (5%)
           (ERR-4,1.0,5.0) half-life (1-5%)
STATUS     (TABLE,,B.M.Ali+,J,ARI,225,112011,2025) Table 2
HISTORY    (20260504C) TT
ENDBIB              26
COMMON               3          3
ERR-1      ERR-2      ERR-3
PER-CENT   PER-CENT   PER-CENT
8.0        5.0        5.0
ENDCOMMON            3
